# FactoryPilot architecture

Build the **hybrid** stack only unless the user explicitly asks for the thick-CPI requirements baseline.

- CAP = admin, OData/BO registry, rate/cache config, dashboard
- FastAPI + LangGraph = insights orchestration
- CPI = thin S/4/Hub OData adapter only
- APIs from SAP Business Accelerator Hub (`docs/api/hub/`)
- LLM via adapters (OpenRouter / AI Core), never hard-coded in graph nodes or CPI
- No RAG/MCP in runtime; no secrets in git
- Follow `AGENTS.md` and `docs/architecture/Architecture_Concept.md`
- Update `CHANGELOG.md` [Unreleased] for structural changes
